WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.943
Six doors open onto the site’s main themes.

00:00:02.993 --> 00:00:06.953
Swipe, or move the mouse to an edge, to look around the hall.

00:00:07.003 --> 00:00:10.800
Click a door to enter its rooms.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:14.028
Each tile opens a chapter.

00:00:14.078 --> 00:00:16.751
The arrows lead to the next chapter.

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:20.391
The back button takes you to the hall.

00:00:20.441 --> 00:00:25.400
Enjoy your visit!
